            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அவர் அகிம்சை வழியில் போராடினார். avar akimcai vaḻiyil pōrāṭiṉār. He fought in the way of non-violence."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அகிம்சை (akimcai) வழி, the path of non-violence."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அகிம்சை (akimcai) is borrowed from Sanskrit ahiṃsā, \"not injuring anything\" (Monier-Williams). Tamil writes the Sanskrit h as க and the final -ā as -ஐ."
            }
          ]
        },
